  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Development Fund (EUF 10) 2014-2028 - European Development Fund (EUF 10)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Europeiska utvecklingsfonden (EUF 10) 2014-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ratification of a financing agreement concerning the eleventh European Development Fund (EDF 11). Sweden shall pay 896,604,897 euros during the period for the next multi-annual budget framework (2014-2020)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sweden&apos;s contribution to the EDF as stipulated by the Internal Agreement and the Cotonou Agreement. The main part of the contribution is managed by the European Commission, whilst a small part is managed by the European Investment Bank. There is thus one donor project number but two channels of delivery. This corresponds to the format used by the Commission.</narrative>
  </description>
